# Schwere Steam-Spieldateien & Content-Manager-Binärcaches (GitHub 100-MB-Schutz)
*.img
*.iso
*.vdi
*.qcow2
*.rom
*.vars
*.kn5
*.bank
*.dds
*.acd
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.pdb
*.dmp
*.msi

# Executables ausschließen, außer Content Manager.exe und AC-Core-Binaries
*.exe
!07_Content_Manager_Binary/Content Manager.exe
!08_Steam_AC_Binaries/*.exe
!08_Steam_AC_Binaries/*.dll
!08_Steam_AC_Binaries/*.zip
!08_Steam_AC_Binaries/*.txt
!08_Steam_AC_Binaries/*.config
!09_Steam_AC_System_Core/**/*.dll
!09_Steam_AC_System_Core/**/*.exe

# Assemblierte Builds & Ausgabeziele ignorieren
dist/
build/
output/

# Content Manager Caches & temporäre Ordner
**/Plugins/
**/Temporary/
**/Static/
**/Logs/
**/Cache/
**/GPUCache/
**/CrashDumps/
**/cef/

# OS & Editor Artifacts
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.history-memo/
.vscode/gemini-mcp/
**/.vscode/gemini-mcp/
